changelog:
Based on [regular-dev v1.2.1](https://github.com/regular-dev/biplanes-revival/releases/tag/v1.2.1) of the original port with some PS Vita port bug fixes.

The game assets are also available on [the website of the original port's authors](https://regular-dev.itch.io/biplanes-revival).

### What works and has been tested
- Playing with bots;
- Creating a server for a local network;
- Connecting to the game via a local network;
- Saving settings and statistics.
- Matchmaking. [Regular-dev confirms that it works](https://github.com/regular-dev/biplanes-revival/pull/8#issuecomment-3164256930). But [with some network settings](https://github.com/regular-dev/biplanes-revival/issues/4#issuecomment-2771024794).

### What is disabled:
- Hotseat two-player game.

### What has been fixed
- Fixed updating statistics for victories over Developer AI and insane AI;
- Fixed saving statistics to a file when exiting the game via Live Area;
- Fixed updating statistics when exiting a match early.

**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/DvaMishkiLapa/biplanes-revival-vita/compare/v1.2.1...v1.2.1-fix1
